# At the café in Russian: кофе, чай, суп
subtitle: "Order soup, tea or coffee in Russian, learn the word that means please, here you are and you're welcome, and see why кофе is a he."
teaches: ["phrases/ordering","vocabulary/food-and-drink"]
thumb: "band \"One word, three jobs\" note \"пожалуйста\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A little story in Russian: мама, папа и кот","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/05-russian-story.cast"}

## At the café in Russian: кофе, чай, суп
level: basic

    icon tom size 140 set twemoji x 130 y 430 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 130 y 320 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon masha size 140 set twemoji x 870 y 430 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 870 y 320 font_size 32 hidden true
    group speakers members ["tom","tom_name","masha","masha_name"] hidden true
    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Здра́вствуйте! Что вы хоти́те?","gloss":"Hello! What would you like?"},{"by":"a","text":"Здра́вствуйте! Суп, пожа́луйста.","gloss":"Hello! Soup, please."}] size 1.4 hidden true
    dialogue talk2 speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"А пить? Чай и́ли ко́фе?","gloss":"And to drink? Tea or coffee?"},{"by":"a","text":"Ко́фе, пожа́луйста.","gloss":"Coffee, please."},{"by":"b","text":"Пожа́луйста!","gloss":"Here you are!"},{"by":"a","text":"Спаси́бо!","gloss":"Thank you!"},{"by":"b","text":"Пожа́луйста!","gloss":"You're welcome!"}] size 1.4 hidden true
    text pz "пожа́луйста" #2f6b8f say пожалуйста x 500 y 560 font_size 64 hidden true
    box pz_1 "please" #2f6b8f x 500 y 445 width 380 height 76 radius 16 font_size 36 hidden true
    box pz_2 "here you are" #2f6b8f x 500 y 350 width 380 height 76 radius 16 font_size 36 hidden true
    box pz_3 "you're welcome" #2f6b8f x 500 y 255 width 380 height 76 radius 16 font_size 36 hidden true
    text pz_say "pa-ZHA-lus-ta" #8f887c x 500 y 160 font_size 34 hidden true
    group pzcard members ["pz","pz_1","pz_2","pz_3","pz_say"] hidden true
    box m_sup "суп" #2f6b8f say true x 320 y 470 width 160 height 100 radius 16 font_size 50 hidden true
    box m_chai "чай" #2f6b8f say true x 500 y 470 width 160 height 100 radius 16 font_size 50 hidden true
    box m_kofe "ко́фе" #2f6b8f say кофе x 680 y 470 width 160 height 100 radius 16 font_size 50 hidden true
    icon i_sup size 80 set twemoji x 320 y 590 or ["bowl with spoon"] icon_look picture of "pot of food" hidden true
    icon i_chai size 80 set twemoji x 500 y 590 or ["hot beverage"] icon_look picture of "teacup without handle" hidden true
    icon i_kofe size 80 set twemoji x 680 y 590 or ["coffee"] icon_look picture of "hot beverage" hidden true
    text g_sup "soup" #8f887c x 320 y 385 font_size 32 hidden true
    text g_chai "tea" #8f887c x 500 y 385 font_size 32 hidden true
    text g_kofe "coffee" #8f887c x 680 y 385 font_size 32 hidden true
    text on_1 "он" #2f6b8f x 320 y 300 font_size 44 hidden true
    text on_2 "он" #2f6b8f x 500 y 300 font_size 44 hidden true
    text ono_3 "оно?" #8a5fa8 x 680 y 300 font_size 44 hidden true
    text on_3 "он" #2f6b8f x 680 y 300 font_size 44 hidden true
    mark ono_x around ono_3 kind strike hidden true
    group menu members ["m_sup","m_chai","m_kofe","i_sup","i_chai","i_kofe","g_sup","g_chai","g_kofe","on_1","on_2","on_3"] hidden true
