        * "суп" match soup
        * "чай" match tea
        * "ко́фе" match coffee
        * "вода́" match water
    icon q_tea size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 450 or ["hot beverage"] icon_look picture of "teacup without handle" hidden true
    icon q_soup size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 450 or ["bowl with spoon"] icon_look picture of "pot of food" hidden true
    icon q_coffee size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 450 or ["coffee"] icon_look picture of "hot beverage" hidden true
    dialogue bye speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Спаси́бо! До свида́ния!","gloss":"Thanks! Goodbye!"},{"by":"b","text":"До свида́ния!","gloss":"Goodbye!"}] size 1.4 hidden true
    text q_kofe "ко́фе" #2f6b8f x 500 y 430 font_size 90 hidden true
    icon f1 size 110 set twemoji x 380 y 450 or ["bowl with spoon"] icon_look picture of "pot of food" hidden true
    icon f2 size 110 set twemoji x 500 y 450 or ["hot beverage"] icon_look picture of "teacup without handle" hidden true
    icon f3 size 110 set twemoji x 620 y 450 or ["coffee"] icon_look picture of "hot beverage" hidden true
    group foods members ["f1","f2","f3"] hidden true
    box r1 "ко́фе, пожа́луйста" #2f6b8f say "кофе, пожалуйста" x 500 y 470 width 440 height 100 radius 22 font_size 48 hidden true
    box r2 "спаси́бо" #2f6b8f say спасибо x 500 y 330 width 300 height 100 radius 22 font_size 48 hidden true
    group recap members ["r1","r2"] hidden true

    card title "At the café"

A: Today Masha is my waitress in a Moscow café, and I'm going to order lunch in Russian.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name

B: Listen to how it goes; afterwards you can tap any bubble to hear it again.
    highlight masha effect circle

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: We both opened with здравствуйте, the polite hello from last time, because a waitress and her customer say вы.
    highlight talk_1 talk_2

B: And что вы хотите means what would you like: there is that вы again.
    highlight talk_1

    erase talk

B: Then I ask what he'd like to drink.
    highlight masha effect circle

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

A: To order, I just named the thing and added пожалуйста, please: суп, пожалуйста; кофе, пожалуйста.
    highlight talk2_2

B: But I said пожалуйста too, as I put the coffee down: here it means here you are.
    highlight talk2_3

B: And when you say спасибо, I answer пожалуйста once more: you're welcome.
    highlight talk2_5

    erase talk2

A: So пожалуйста does three jobs: please, here you are, and you're welcome.
    draw pz pz_1 pz_2 pz_3

A: And it's shorter than it looks: пожалуйста, with the й hardly heard.
    draw pz_say

    erase pzcard

A: Now the menu: суп, soup, from lesson one; чай, tea; and кофе, coffee.
    draw m_sup i_sup g_sup m_chai i_chai g_chai m_kofe i_kofe g_kofe

B: Чай brings two new letters: Ч, which says ch, and Й, a short ee, like the y in boy.
    blocking false

    highlight m_chai part ^ч color #d0865f duration 2.4

    highlight m_chai part й$ color #d0865f duration 3

A: And кофе has one more: Ф, which says f.
    highlight m_kofe part ф color #d0865f

A: Lesson two's rule still works: суп and чай end in a consonant, so both are он.
    blocking false

    highlight m_sup part п$ color #2f6b8f duration 1.6

    highlight m_chai part й$ color #2f6b8f duration 1.6

    draw on_1 on_2 parallel true

B: Кофе ends in е, so the rule says оно.
    highlight m_kofe part е$ color #8a5fa8

    draw ono_3

B: But кофе is он, like папа: one of the few that break the rule.
    draw ono_x

    erase ono_3 ono_x

    draw on_3

B: In relaxed talk you'll hear оно as well, but он is always right.
    highlight on_3 masha

    hide menu

    hide speakers

    draw match

    ask "Match each Russian word to its meaning." on match store m stage own test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Суп, soup; чай, tea; кофе, coffee; and вода, water, from lesson one.
        wrong: You got {m} on the first try.

    erase match

    draw q_tea

    ask "Masha asks: чай или кофе? You want tea. Type it." answer ["чай"] translit true keys АБВДЕЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЧ reveal Чай! reveal_at q_tea test t1
        right: Чай: Ч, then а, then the short Й.
        wrong: It starts with the new letter that says ch.

    erase q_tea

    draw q_soup

    quiz "Masha puts your soup down and says пожалуйста. What does she mean?" test t1
        right: Here you are: handing something over, пожалуйста means here you are.
        wrong: She isn't asking for anything, and you haven't thanked her yet.
        * Please
        + Here you are
        * You're welcome

    erase q_soup

    draw q_kofe

    quiz "Is кофе он, она or оно?" reveal он reveal_at q_kofe test t1
        right: Он: кофе ends in е, but careful speakers call it он.
        wrong: Don't trust the last letter this time.
        + он
        * она
        * оно

    erase q_kofe

    draw q_coffee

    ask "Masha brings your coffee. Type what you say to her." answer ["спасибо"] translit true keys АБВДЕЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЧ reveal Спаси́бо! reveal_at.x 500 reveal_at.y 290 test t1
        right: Спасибо: thank you. And she'll answer пожалуйста.
        wrong: You're thanking her: спасибо, from the hello lesson.

    erase q_coffee

    show speakers

    draw foods

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase foods

A: So a café order is the thing you want plus пожалуйста, and спасибо when it arrives.
    draw r1 r2

    erase recap

    draw bye

    draw bye

